{"name":"Imnescar","status":"ok","title":"Imnescar","pageId":79762,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\"><nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Imnescar\" title=\"Category:Maps of Imnescar\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Imnescar</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Town</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amn\" title=\"Amn\">Amn</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/West_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"West Faerûn\">west Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">17,000<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p10_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p10-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> in <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Imnescar</b> was a small town in southwest <a href=\"/wiki/Amn\" title=\"Amn\">Amn</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p10_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p10-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Imnescar?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Imnescar was considered an agricultural center for the nation's south and was famous for its fruits. These included <a href=\"/wiki/Orange\" title=\"Orange\">oranges</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Tangerine\" title=\"Tangerine\">tangerines</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Grape\" title=\"Grape\">grapes</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Date\" title=\"Date\">dates</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lemon\" title=\"Lemon\">lemons</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lime\" title=\"Lime\">limes</a>, avocados, and <a href=\"/wiki/Artichoke\" title=\"Artichoke\">artichokes</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p10_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p10-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Imnescar was also known to be a popular waystation for those traveling along the <a href=\"/wiki/Trade_Way\" title=\"Trade Way\">Trade Way</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p10_1-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p10-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Imnescar?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the <a href=\"/wiki/479_DR\" title=\"479 DR\">Year of Forestsfrost, 479 DR</a>, Prince <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Imnel_Torlath\" title=\"Imnel Torlath\">Imnel Torlath</a> and his armies fought ogres on the <a href=\"/wiki/Small_Teeth\" title=\"Small Teeth\">Small Teeth</a>, restoring trade between <a href=\"/wiki/Crimmor\" title=\"Crimmor\">Crimmor</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Murann\" title=\"Murann\">Murann</a>. The site of the battle was known as <i>Imnel's Scar</i>, and would later became the town of Imnescar.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-LoI2-A-p21_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI2-A-p21-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\">